{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14778","headline":"秋晚河西县楼送浑中允赴朝阙 · 卢纶","name":"秋晚河西县楼送浑中允赴朝阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼吹玉箫，车马上河桥。\n岐路自奔隘，壶觞终寂寥。\n芳兰生贵里，片玉立清朝。\n今日台庭望，心遥非地遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}